Knothole... {p60}why should we leave it all behind after
Robotnik's gone?"}, MessageBox {message = "Leon: Princess...{p60} the people need a ruler."}, Do(function() self.scene.player.state = "idleup" end), MessageBox {message = "Sally: Everyone here is fighting Robotnik to save our friends and family, Leon... {p60}not to save a kingdom..."}, MessageBox {message = "Sally: ...so once we finally do{p60}, why then should my voice suddenly be elevated above everyone elses? {p120}
